{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24140390812298710", "organization": {"id": "310125361166872", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "24140390812298710"}]}, "id": "2335936523475639"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "24140390812298710", "release_date": 1772128800, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25791979437139831"}, "id": "31001384189507199"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1772629277, "id": "25779857051685403", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v12", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 11, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "25783097588028016"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "24140390812298710"}, "id": "25783097588028016", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "24140390812298710", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "3777604799205688"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4329000044004166", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fixer Undercover", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\ud83d\udd27 Olvidate del traje, agarr\u00e1 tu caja de herramientas.\nComo Agente 404, te infiltr\u00e1s en Redemption Prison con llaves, taladros y huevos. Cada ca\u00f1o roto y cable pelado es tu cobertura. Improvis\u00e1 y desarm\u00e1 el sistema desde adentro. Nada de gadgets: solo herramientas y ma\u00f1a.\n\n\n\ud83c\udfae FIXER UNDERCOVER convierte la prisi\u00f3n en tu taller de rompecabezas. Agarr\u00e1 el taladro y revent\u00e1 cerraduras. Cort\u00e1 conductos \u00abdefectuosos\u00bb con la amoladora. Con f\u00edsicas realistas y respuesta h\u00e1ptica, vas a sentir cada tornillo, cada cable y cada clic del mecanismo.\n\n\n\ud83e\udd16 No est\u00e1s solo. Winston es tu socio volador: hacker, explorador, fuente de data. Cuando las papas quemen, te va a sacar del l\u00edo. Probablemente.\n\n\n\ud83d\udd12 El programa \u00abBorn Again\u00bb del alcaide Kozlov convierte criminales en ciudadanos modelo\u2026 eso cree el mundo. Detr\u00e1s del milagro hay una conspiraci\u00f3n bancada con millones en guita sucia.\n\n\n\ud83e\udde9 La prisi\u00f3n es un rompecabezas gigante. Sos el \u00fanico con la ma\u00f1a para desarmarlo. Encontr\u00e1 las fallas de dise\u00f1o, improvis\u00e1 con tu equipo y romp\u00e9 el sistema desde adentro.\n\n\n\ud83d\udc64 Sos el Fixer: un agente fantasma escondido a plena vista como empleado de mantenimiento. Tu caja de herramientas es tu arsenal. Tu cobertura es perfecta. Nadie le da bola a un Fixer con una llave inglesa.\n\u26a1 Infiltrate. Improvis\u00e1. Expon\u00e9.", "short_description": "Otros agentes tienen gadgets. T\u00fa tienes un destornillador y tu ingenio. Ponte en la piel del Agente 404 en esta aventura VR inspirada en escape rooms reales. Infiltrado como Fixer, debes adentrarte en Redemption Prison para descubrir los oscuros secretos del programa Born Again. Resuelve intrincados puzles, improvisa con tus herramientas y planea tu fuga antes de convertirte en parte del sistema. En esta prisi\u00f3n, el ingenio es tu \u00fanica salida."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "250925 Fixer KA new 260205_Meta_512x512 ICON B.png", "id": "25969932116000806", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_25969932142667470_8175911503580704525_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6lGB7XHPBvoQ7kNvwGU8iDI&_nc_oc=AdkA8UjH8rHp5mHOj-2OOwZSytZ50flZiuyEHt4G9nMk0HNjao1fX5FsvFo_kzQb3v0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwDP8xujXKayADaSk3ZiHK5Lzs5XKc4-BheO3jseGwr4g&oe=69BAA223"}, {"file_name": "Meta_2560x1440_COVER_LOGO.png", "id": "3161711760645195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820648_3161711763978528_5031376689229522012_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=voQYb0wlNFIQ7kNvwE6R4oR&_nc_oc=AdmRGlBBJngw_oZzGh9mhnn5UNrZ8LFY5D9wtQeykl7ib4lg_gJdW1nFrlbgXXRxI3A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyIunHVe9BvFIGnc2IgEP6NxVOTtdBAPFd6ElzGCwA9gA&oe=69BA8F7F"}, {"file_name": "250925 Fixer KA new 250925_META 7 B.png", "id": "2286571981767823", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307954_2286571985101156_3644756043702339770_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1eh61iEHQ6sQ7kNvwGpo5fY&_nc_oc=Adl_qEjjCg6HG82bOFWS7qHsQ6n498bXNIr33J0w7mODWuqR5XC4ibfuWydJxbc91c8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxwM17--ltRYJ2kuAFphudNUzNii4AviH6BrpDOGBODzA&oe=69BAA94A"}, {"file_name": "FIXER KA_META 5 B.png", "id": "2033533050608786", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821719_2033533053942119_4437345327562270429_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1XZ3m77FC6AQ7kNvwE85fsI&_nc_oc=AdljGIQVVA3NZflcCi4OHvLfZn6O2YSBrJy-w8oO3I8DgLtpQUB05j2bm6XWOOKN6Xo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzV-o1laqkFCwk7x3NuHjD9XHoobqAOxgRgOmZpIlZfLQ&oe=69BA86D6"}, {"file_name": "250925 Fixer KA new 250925_META 4 B.png", "id": "1699672084051288", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819396_1699672087384621_472175002763393089_n.p